# named Structure is a callable, visible both ways (docs :768, :937): `Model: fresh` is Model's call, refused.
Model: fresh
Model:
    size_t: value 41U
end: Model
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
